title: "rayleigh: calibrated power planning for paired model evaluations"
abstract: >-
  Item-count planning for paired comparisons of language models, a known-truth
  calibration of pilot-based planning rules under the exact McNemar test, and a
  prospective repeated-decoding experiment on six open models.
